menu "Tamagezi"

config TAMAGEZI_TIME_SCALE
    int "Active-time simulation multiplier"
    range 1 120
    default 1
    help
        Multiplies elapsed active time for development and hardware acceptance.
        Keep this at 1 for normal play. Values such as 60 allow growth, care,
        illness, cooldown, and pet-day boundaries to be tested quickly.

endmenu
